        "nobel_worthiness": "The jamming framework identified a general transition governing rigidity and dynamics in disordered matter, with links across granular, glassy, and soft materials.",
        "attribution": "Liu and Nagel were central in formulating and developing the framework and its cross-material significance.",
        "maturity": "The subject has sustained theoretical and experimental development over decades, though its precise status as a sharp universal transition depends on system and conditions.",
